    "body": "How about this?\r\n```rust\r\n    let java_command = context\r\n        .get_env(\"JAVA_HOME\")\r\n        .and_then(|java_home| {\r\n            Path::new(&java_home)\r\n                .join(\"bin\")\r\n                .join(\"java\")\r\n                .to_str()\r\n                .map(str::to_owned)\r\n        })\r\n        .unwrap_or_else(|| \"java\".to_owned());\r\n```",
