    "body": "I just tested something similar locally:\r\n```rust\r\n    let java_command = context\r\n        .get_env(\"JAVA_HOME\")\r\n        .map(PathBuf::from)\r\n        .and_then(|path| {\r\n            path.join(\"bin\")\r\n                .join(\"java\")\r\n                .into_os_string()\r\n                .into_string()\r\n                .ok()\r\n        })\r\n        .unwrap_or(\"java\".to_string());\r\n```\r\n\r\nHonestly, I'm not that proficient in Rust to figure out what's better so just pasting it here for you to decide :shrug: ",
